<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  td, th {
    padding: 8px 0;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .header-text {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <div class="header-text">OFFICE OF THE REGISTRAR</div>
      <div>
        <span data-field="address.street">{{ address.street }}</span><br>
        <span data-field="address.city_state_zip">{{ address.city_state_zip }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <div>Phone: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></div>
      <div>Fax: <span data-field="fax">{{ fax }}</span></div>
      <div>Email: <span data-field="email">{{ email }}</span></div>
      <div>Visit: <span data-field="website">{{ website }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h1 style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0 10px 0; font-size: 18pt;">UNDERGRADUATE REQUEST TO ENROLL IN INTEGRATED BACCALAUREATE AND MASTER'S DEGREE BRIDGE COURSE</h1>

  <p>Applicant must complete this form, obtain the required signatures, and submit the form to the <span data-field="office_name">{{ office_name }}</span>, <span data-field="address.street">{{ address.street }}</span>. The following regulations apply:</p>

  <ol>
    <li>Applicant must be of senior classification (90 hours earned), or beginning final two semesters (fall and spring) as demonstrated by a written degree completion plan.</li>
    <li>Applicant must have filed an application for graduation in the Office of the Registrar, <span data-field="address.street">{{ address.street }}</span>.</li>
    <li>Applicant must have applied for graduation in the School of Graduate Studies or to International Graduate Admissions, as applicable, and have been accepted into an integrated program.</li>
    <li>Applicant must have fulfilled the course prerequisites.</li>
  </ol>

  <p>Applicant may enroll in a maximum of three (400B, 500B, 600B) courses to satisfy requirements for the Baccalaureate and Master's Integrated Degree Program. (Accountancy and MBA programs allow a maximum of 6 sh.)</p>

  <div class="section-title">TO BE COMPLETED BY APPLICANT</div>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>STAR Number</th>
        <th>Department</th>
        <th>Course No.</th>
        <th>Section</th>
        <th>Term</th>
        <th>Year</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in applicant_courses %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="applicant_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].star_number">{{ item.star_number }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="applicant_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].department">{{ item.department }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="applicant_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].course_no">{{ item.course_no }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="applicant_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].section">{{ item.section }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="applicant_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].term">{{ item.term }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="applicant_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].year">{{ item.year }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px;">
    <div>
      <p>Signature, Undergraduate Advisor</p>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 200px;" data-field="signature_undergraduate_advisor">{{ signature_undergraduate_advisor }}</div>
      <p>Date</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Signature, Graduate Dept. Chair</p>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 200px;" data-field="signature_graduate_dept_chair">{{ signature_graduate_dept_chair }}</div>
      <p>Date</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">TO BE COMPLETED BY OFFICE OF THE REGISTRAR</div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px;">
    <div>
      <p>Approved: <span data-field="registrar_approved_status">{{ registrar_approved_status }}</span></p>
      <p>Not Approved: <span data-field="registrar_not_approved_status">{{ registrar_not_approved_status }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Signature, Office of the Registrar</p>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 200px;" data-field="signature_office_of_the_registrar">{{ signature_office_of_the_registrar }}</div>
      <p>Date</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">TO BE COMPLETED BY GRADUATE OFFICE</div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px;">
    <div>
      <p>Approved: <span data-field="graduate_approved_status">{{ graduate_approved_status }}</span></p>
      <p>Not Approved: <span data-field="graduate_not_approved_status">{{ graduate_not_approved_status }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Signature, Graduate Office</p>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 200px;" data-field="signature_graduate_office">{{ signature_graduate_office }}</div>
      <p>Date</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 100px;">
    <p>FOR OFFICE USE ONLY:</p>
    <p><span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span></p>
    <p style="text-align: right; margin-top: 50px;">Revised: <span data-field="revision_date">{{ revision_date }}</span></p>
  </div>
</div>